   <text>
      <body>

         <div n="1">
            <head>Shiji I: Basic Annals</head>
            <p><title>Basic Annals of Qin</title>: In the <span corresp="fifty-second_year">fifty-second year</span>, the people of <placeName n="7">Zhou</placeName> fled east, and their vessels, the <term n="8">Nine Tripods</term>, passed into <placeName n="1">Qin</placeName>. <span corresp="Zhou_now_first_perished">Zhou now first perished</span>.</p>
         </div>

         <div n="2">
            <head>Shiji II: Tables</head>
            <p><placeName n="1">Qin</placeName>: Took <placeName n="5">Western Zhou</placeName>. <persName n="51">Wang Ji</persName> was <term n="45">executed in the marketplace</term>.</p>
            <p><placeName n="11">Chu</placeName>: Took <placeName n="37">Lu</placeName>; the <persName n="52">Lord of Lu</persName> was enfeoffed at <placeName n="47">Ju</placeName>.</p>
         </div>

         <div n="3">
            <head>Shiji III: Hereditary Houses</head>
            <p><title>Hereditary House of the Duke of Shao of Yan</title>: In the <span corresp="third_year">third year</span> he died, and his son, <span corresp="the_present_king">the present king</span>, <persName n="53">Xi</persName>, was set up.</p>
            <p><title>Hereditary House of Zhao</title>: In the <span corresp="eleventh_year">eleventh year</span>, made <placeName n="48">Yuanshi</placeName> a <term n="12">Fortress</term> and <placeName n="49">Shangyuan</placeName> a <term n="10">County</term>. <persName n="54">Lord Wuyang, Zheng Anping</persName>, died, and his lands were taken back.</p>
         </div>

      </body>
